 (text "Guarded carrier rail allocation: PG1 UNSELECTED. NOT accepted for promotion or fabrication. See study report." (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "86205400-1234-4567-8900-000000010270")) (text "New split-rail carrier required; a socket interposer alone cannot split the original power plane. Labels name Seed pads and carrier nets. External 5V never joins USB/VIN." (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "86205400-1234-4567-8900-000000010271")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))